  "idea": "Greenshot: lightweight screenshot utility with instant annotation tools",
  "text": "Stop sending confusing screenshots: add clear numbered steps with this free app. Guiding clients through complex software settings using text messages leads to costly configuration errors and frustration. Circling random buttons with crude pen drawings fails to communicate chronological sequence or clear operational context. Greenshot places sequential step bubbles, highlights input fields, and blurs sensitive account details with simple keyboard shortcuts. You eliminate recurring client support tickets permanently.",
